    "Managed asset lifecycle and every other economic lane still lack equivalent real module guests and receipts.",
    "The full 64-command 73-receipt recursive replay remains absent. Epoch proof children remain quarantined structural journal emitters, while the historical economic lane receipt remains unmounted and absent from every route.",
    "The Python hygiene runner executes only the pinned pytest nodes. Rust tests, clippy, formatting, the guest build, and the ignored real proof command are separately replayed evidence.",
    "The Python/Rust fixture and exact imported Rust core provide bounded differential evidence rather than a universal refinement theorem or formal verification of the implementation.",
